## Why this close exists

`DEC-21` ruled *preserve* for the local Windows account name carried in ten tracked CAD failure
records. An independent public-release review measured its stated grounds and found them false:
the count was `41` against a measured **52**, the name is **not** already in the commit history
— every commit is authored under a GitHub noreply address — and the repository is **not** public.
The owner reopened the decision, ruled **B — sanitize before publication**, and set the stop line
at the publication gate.

